# Reference comparison with the original: Kriz (kayit9.sav): atilgan_ai enemies on the pier, inventory, map, pause menu
# and a mine throw (the save's Aktif_Silah is 7, Mayin). The menus come first because aiming clears
# EnvaterAcilabilirmi. Each atilgan contact costs 4*TIME*(OyunZorluk+1) per wing trace on both sides (8 per tick in
# contact, measured equal); when its attack comes depends on random() waypoint choices, so the original's own runs
# differ (first attack 43-114 ticks after load across Wine runs; native, seed 0, at 52). A knock-back onto the thrown
# mine (bomba_tara, < 60 quants) detonates it under the player (1200/dist), which can end the run.
realtime on
#wine: wait-log 1st
#wine: sleep 28
load-save 9
wait until $level == "kriz.wmb" timeout 7200
#wine: wait-log kriz.wmb 600
#wine: wait-log Physics 120
frames 300
assert player != 0
capture kriz_loaded
press M
frames 120
assert EM_Acik == 1
capture kriz_inventory
press Escape
frames 120
press H
frames 120
assert h_menu_aktifmi == 1
capture kriz_map
press Escape
frames 120
press Escape
frames 120
assert STM_Acik == 1
capture kriz_pause
press Escape
frames 120
# Combat: hold aim (S, GA_Tuslar[4]) and fire (D, GA_Tuslar[5]) with the active weapon (Mayin: mayin_at throws a mine).
down S
frames 60
capture kriz_aim
press D 6
frames 12
capture kriz_fire
up S
